      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在我把千代王送到宿舍门口的时候，\r\n她突然停下了脚步。",
      "source_fingerprint": "035dac8134e398c885e34e58a25daad3976ba1d34d69b87f02d3e6b974ff00f0",
